p fell out it was just that that I  needed to send out my letter  I read the whole Bible from cover to  cover and received a sense of peace and  calm despite my surroundings my whole  perspective on life changed I began to  believe that my purpose was to give back  instead of destroying the people around  me when I got out I realized my way of  giving back was through the world of  fitness and that's when I started comedy  calm body is a present style boot camp  that hires formerly incarcerated  individuals to teach fitness classes  based on the workout I developed in  myself in just two and a half years calm  body has gone from workouts in the park  to studios in NYC with 12 employees over  7,000 clients and over 200 classes per  week my business has been featured in  over a hundred international media  outlets today I travel the country  visiting presidents training inmates in  hopes of creating a pipeline of trainers  for calm body our mission is to create a  bridge between two communities young  professionals and formerly incarcerated  individuals at calm body we view each  other as real human beings and seek to  break down the stereotypes that formerly  incarcerated individuals face  whoever dwells in the shelter of the  most high will rest in the shadow  Almighty  thanks for reading close  you  [Music]  [Applause]
 

